### HTML Comment Refs

Content refs defined inside HTML comments, rendered across columns:

<!--
htmlcomment {
This text is hidden in an HTML comment but appears via reference in all three columns.
}
-->

/
{{htmlcomment}}
|
{{htmlcomment}}
|
{{htmlcomment}}
/

%

hiddencontent {
note(
# Hidden Note from Beyond!
This note is stored in the hidden area, but appears as a reference!
)
}
